      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "わたしの隣に座っていた男の人が、おばあさんに席をゆずったのです。",
      "english_translation": "The man who was sitting next to me gave his seat to my grandmother."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "japanese": "その男の人は、わたしの前に立ちました。",
      "english_translation": "That man stood in front of me."
